"photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/7d7X5ZgdHYAZ04oHTRocuKM3e39.jpg","tmdbId":1790376},{"name":"Mabel Li","character":"Aunt Vidala","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/4ONlB3kLaCq9PmlRSk6bFxelzln.jpg","tmdbId":3056053},{"name":"Amy Seimetz","character":"Paula MacKenzie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/qa7vCi7TViddGjuYEszLdi8DRqN.jpg","tmdbId":139150},{"name":"Brad Alexander","character":"Garth Chapin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/uuWREvLY5MAdjJSuhKGCut44AdC.jpg","tmdbId":3919189},{"name":"Zarrin Darnell-Martin","character":"Aunt Gabbana","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/fl8e8B2EFLu0RonaOG8UKZMvCCS.jpg","tmdbId":1517741},{"name":"Eva Foote","character":"Aunt Estee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/4Ma8calHkVwCW23MfZPXd5oe4Jb.jpg","tmdbId":3576223},{"name":"Isolde Ardies","character":"Hulda Edwardson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/hTLNTyv3QzZDNKECvGJJ3sbfO8A.jpg","tmdbId":5343230},{"name":"Shechinah Mpumlwana","character":"Jehosheba Yardarm","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/gaD35y3LJxShn91RHrpl94G2nrU.jpg","tmdbId":2710332},{"name":"Birva Pandya","character":"Miriam Dawson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/9LEUlUrpTGTSRBNPujlh1MJXUAa.jpg","tmdbId":2277807},{"name":"Kira Guloien","character":"Rosa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/e4WFh5H6FAA3mFbRdkv3UNUw9pR.jpg","tmdbId":2512529}],"writers":[{"name":"Bruce Miller","character":"Bruce Miller","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/h66XSPXnWfkJVMGJRXHc4RoJXLH.jpg","tmdbId":157125},{"name":"Elise Brown","character":"Elise Brown","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/AozUxI7RxrHlnqll7ReIse0zamN.jpg","tmdbId":2889947},{"name":"Sam Rubinek","character":"Sam Rubinek","photo":null,"tmdbId":4075491},{"name":"Nate Burke","character":"Nate Burke","photo":null,"tmdbId":4075490},{"name":"Margaret Atwood","character":"Margaret Atwood","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/qxIYNr61CnIJBsFiu5xf3iT3bOe.jpg","tmdbId":92072}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTEwhRamZaa3BhfFAsJHWmsBwEm.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt10970762:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Flores preciosas","overview":"En los pasillos de la academia preparatoria de la Tía Lydia, la más exclusiva de Gilead, Agnes Mackenzie recibe la tarea de orientar a una nueva \"Chica Perla\". Pronto, una frágil alianza comienza a formarse entre ellas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Tkyje1zDvhmYDVQj0noXBjsIbu.jpg","released":"2026-04-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Dientes perfectos","overview":"Mientras Agnes inicia los rituales que marcan su transición a la madurez, lucha con las confusas emociones de la adolescencia. Por su parte, Daisy es sometida al riguroso sistema de disciplina de Gilead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AbuxRmJCSJehovfyVyOivjVWF0m.jpg","released":"2026-04-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"40 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Daisy","overview":"Un incidente durante una excursión escolar despierta recuerdos fragmentados en Daisy sobre su vida en Toronto, revelando un pasado oculto y un mundo destrozado por la violencia que creía haber dejado atrás.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GkpptniSxyTMTUEkCvPng14UlD.jpg","released":"2026-04-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"52 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Té verde","overview":"Durante una reunión de las \"Chicas Verdes\", Daisy se esfuerza por cumplir con sus tareas asignadas, mientras Agnes comienza a comprender la cruda realidad de lo que significa ser mujer bajo el régimen de Gilead.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azUwuFCAY9ZgOq70zKeQH6WzLIk.jpg","released":"2026-04-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"La pelota","overview":"En un baile de debutantes donde las jóvenes son exhibidas ante los Comandantes, la ilusión de elegancia empieza a desmoronarse. Agnes descubre que el estatus de Garth ha cambiado drásticamente.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lPQ8B6cPJY04h48pPRqQPn4hQG3.jpg","released":"2026-04-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"43 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Estadio","overview":"Mientras las Tías revisan los registros de ascendencia para concretar matrimonios, Agnes planea una oportunidad para encontrar el amor. En paralelo, Lydia reflexiona sobre las brutales decisiones que marcaron su ascenso al poder en el estadio tras el golpe de estado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cLHMR4BTLgOATD3yhVM2VoKKiRH.jpg","released":"2026-04-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Compromiso","overview":"Sinopsis: El pasado secreto de Daisy amenaza con salir a la luz, mientras Agnes lidia con una propuesta de matrimonio no deseada y sentimientos prohibidos. Becka encuentra una bondad inesperada en uno de sus posibles pretendientes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/86ynL8BR9C9APp2dnMhlPEMSwco.jpg","released":"2026-05-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Roto","overview":"Las grietas en el sistema se vuelven imposibles de ignorar. Los personajes deben enfrentar las consecuencias de sus actos de rebeldía mientras las tensiones internas en la academia de las Tías llegan a un punto crítico.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tlADE6qeEP588BNHhv6gF1NFtlR.jpg","released":"2026-05-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"39 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Marat Sade","overview":"Un episodio cargado de tensión psicológica donde las lealtades son puestas a prueba. El título alude a una lucha entre la revolución y la locura dentro de los confines del régimen.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2S6HvmFV4FVaGo4hZ7MZ7wP32CX.jpg","released":"2026-05-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"39 min"},{"id":"tt10970762:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Tijeras de podar","overview":"El final de temporada. Los hilos del destino de Agnes, Daisy y la Tía Lydia convergen en una revelación que sacudirá los cimientos de Gilead, preparando el terreno para una resistencia a gran escala.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zM8G8o5ObaZ0zvvgbTl2muHMRab.jpg","released":"2026-05-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"}]}}